WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.721
Deciphera is a browser simulator for
Bitcoin transfers.

00:00:04.098 --> 00:00:06.671
JavaScript models an off-chain
transaction,

00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:09.606
then turns the same event into three
explanations:

00:00:09.606 --> 00:00:13.210
one for a client, one for an auditor,
and one for a technical reader.

00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:16.183
Next, add tests that compare each
narrative

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:18.962
with an explicitly defined transaction
state.
